    "/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Scripts/Modules/Meta4Notification/meta4_notification_manager/AllCollectibleFoundTopMessage": "All Collectibles Found!",
    "79843EAD40FC444C1187F693C9779EA2": "Thanks !",
    "6EE7BED2472BE4BAE1F551A7C7C409A6": "Hey take this cool perks !",
    "E5F43F9B4CF5EB274F3090838465B723": "Yes",
    "E81ED8784A8980B2D99FCE99D8F447AD": "No",
    "6E39C1AB4D3D2C9B7559C4B5F05DBC14": "Do you like my cool perks",
    "228F0FB94586E7F809B077934DFF766D": "Thanks!",
    "A1B7B5D04AD1BA5DDA282885FAA2ECED": "Thanks!",
    "BCACD48D403D46BBE544E69C706E9CE3": "Thanks!",
    "6672364F47F749973C7046A322D87820": "Thanks!",
    "7283392D43DA26FA4AB76E966AE8944A": "Thanks!",
    "E3260F5A47A87B0F831DAC8DD616084A": "Thanks!",
    "613D849449E23A618889939A6ED03C4B": "I'm back, thanks to you! I noticed you might benefit from a demonstration on proper take-off protocol. If you come across a bounce pad, it'll help you get airborne.",
    "A4BD43EA400CFF3AE6D2998B415F8669": "Oh, thank goodness! Iʻm home! Before you go, let me show you what I've learned about creativity from Bonnie. It'll really let your imagination fly!",
    "CB13EC36498085F4DDA3358B63B6E538": "Ahh, home, sweet home. Now, if you wanna keep exploring around here, and you enjoy getting' into tricky spaces, this'll help you get past the cobwebs and stuff.",
    "735827ED460AF7541C0A73A8AFC51C18": "Yeeeee-haa, I'm back! Thanks, partner! Here—take this pickaxe. It's real useful for swingin' and smashin' and breakin' stuff in hard-to-reach spots.",
    "40A853A94B29E4851D08D8A649DDE051": "Phew! I feel safer already, thank you! Could I ask you for another favor? I need help moving some of the heavy objects around the room - my arms are too tiny to lift them, but I'll teach you how!",
    "41E326B64915607DD4EF31A4F986EB4A": "Boy does it feel good to be back! Thanks, partner! Here, I want you to have this toy flint-knock. I saw some hidden targets around here that you might like to use for practice.",
    "553DC0054C77690FF83EE780A6C22324": "Got it!",
    "9A4C097B436E461F46622EA3BCEE4289": "Got it!",
    "99494A47496BC2F329E9FBB3CECFF5FC": "Got it!",
    "7712EC3E46C5B53D90702BB0FAD5753C": "Got it!",
    "7490354C4D57142B9F953E8D421A257C": "Got it!",
    "8E7298B746CC31A5A36FCCAB774F6913": "Got it!",
    "455DEC384B2A1C264E3ED798A1FB71B0": "Got it!",
    "927041B84840F2F1834BE99C40791E4F": "Got it!",
    "FA757FB848559E8A81FE0A970DB30135": "Got it!",
    "D1DA7D154635C7D46137E992DD9DBF6C": "Got it!",
    "8A3EC82A473C2F3194CF94B9CB1AD8EE": "Got it!",
    "AB5B46AF40E21A22EF27298D69B49902": "Got it!",
    "3176A571488C980A7B518687E3453EB2": "Got it!",
    "B8D4574246DE1DB8D2CE40A862A1CE3E": "Got it!",
    "014A933643958C917F77DE94A75A6AEC": "Got it!",
    "09B757814B4D750315D5128E8B7D42F2": "Just hop on a bounce pad, and it'll launch you to a new location!",
    "0E887C8F47F865D2CE9BE89CB7016B6D": "If you wanna go to new and exciting places, just use your imagination!",
    "9DB9012140B65E62CB27A8A892F05DE0": "Did you try slipping through any cobwebs yet? They're usually found in dark, out of the way places.",
    "04141ED2481D2306A94A70806FB80D81": "If ya see a wall with a big crack in it, you can smash through it with that pickaxe!",
    "BB34AB874415B7DB55EFFD80A7AA8A78": "Thank you for helping me move those heavy objects!",
    "5E6E45CB4ABD6F1DC42481A6D8083DD1": "How's the target practice going?",
    "65FF029C48FB48E7E51CE59DDF963AE7": "Well done! You got everyone back in one piece. Yay, you!",
    "C7B460A14B623B0CE5863C97D3C42F43": "Would you mind saving those toys? Bonnie would really miss them if they're not here when she gets back.",
    "80906603447BDAE3C612479FED7E481F": "Well, you're off to a good start. But what about the other toys?",
    "52C46BB2410CFA3BD84ECEBB3F56DEF0": "Sometimes strange things happen with tech. What can you do?",
    "02D51197422F552741E72E8538F7CEB9": "I’d help, but I need some time on my charging dock.",
    "43AFA12041159E4E9B106EA00CBC612B": "Let's go!",
    "3A310DA144FEAD6D9B94FAA3167F549D": "Let's go!",
    "52FA4D5F48EA0F94CF080A91DC5D5CA0": "Let's go!",
    "/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Scripts/Modules/Meta4GameManager/ResetGameConfirmationConfirm": "Let's go!",
    "715400D24FC4FD0F7EE54EB499A67491": "Maybe later.",
    "31B606F347577EDE0D5A1AA8F7E04660": "Maybe later.",
    "9272913D4FF67CA73ADA7FB848E7C12F": "Maybe later.",
    "EB9E03914592DC9B02214499DF0BEC82": "You want to celebrate... again? Alright, it might be overdoing it a little, but why not? Let's go for it!",
    "99DC381C408B34144E7D95AB5F1877BD": "Alright, show-off. You just waltzed in here and saved everyone without needing any of my detailed instructions. Well, you're impressive and you saved the day. Let's celebrate!",
    "EE1B3D6C4619A9B2381B678DEB8DB5F9": "Why, hello there! My name is Smarty Pants! My friends somehow got zapped away to parts unknown. Could you hop through these portals and find a way to rescue them? Please?",
    "239C9C2E4BBBB299A8838EA3B3E855D5": "Color me impressed! You figured out the rescue process without repeated positive reinforcement. Now get back out there. Some of my friends are still trapped!",
    "55E00FE44BEFE9472A42C0A81C742E4C": "Well, well, well, you actually pulled it off! And by \"you\" I mean \"we,\" as my assistance was invaluable. Now let's gather the troops together and celebrate!",
    "A6241DD04FA58351F1EAA98861D099AF": "Time to be a hero! Head through the portals, find the toys, and see how you can help them before bringing them back! Easy, right? Of course, every great adventure SEEMS easy…",
    "6D175C0443AF4213C3C64C9FD04C9A69": "Well, look who completed one of the rescue programs! Now that you know how the plumbing works, you can just rinse and repeat for the rest of them. Plunge back in and go rescue the others!",
    "/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Default__E_Npc_Interaction_Buzz_C/Scripts-Modules-Meta4Entity-meta4_npc_dialogue_interactable_component_0/(/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Scripts/Modules/Meta4Entity/meta4_npc_dialogue_interactable_component:)CanInteractMessage": "Talk to Buzz Lightyear",
    "/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Default__E_Npc_Interaction_Forky_C/Scripts-Modules-Meta4Entity-meta4_npc_dialogue_interactable_component_0/(/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Scripts/Modules/Meta4Entity/meta4_npc_dialogue_interactable_component:)CanInteractMessage": "Talk to Forky",
    "/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Default__E_Npc_Interaction_Hamm_C/Scripts-Modules-Meta4Entity-meta4_npc_dialogue_interactable_component_0/(/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Scripts/Modules/Meta4Entity/meta4_npc_dialogue_interactable_component:)CanInteractMessage": "Talk to Hamm",
    "/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Default__E_Npc_Interaction_Jessie_C/Scripts-Modules-Meta4Entity-meta4_npc_dialogue_interactable_component_0/(/meta4@fortnite.com/Caboom/Scripts/Modules/Meta4Entity/meta4_npc_dialogue_interactable_component:)CanInteractMessage": "Talk to Jessie",
